<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fifth Third cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fifth Third cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said Monday it cut Fifth Third Bancorp to hold from buy due to price.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 to 77-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Fred Cummings said in a report the price rose 23.2 percent in January and is up 28.6 percent since he upgraded the stock in October.</p>
<p>-- The Cincinnati-based bank's fundamentals are strong, including &quot;superb execution of the basics: risk, expense, balance sheet and capital management,&quot; Cummings said.</p>
<p>((Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077))</p>
